y for the latest qualifying flight, and AL712 only had 2 seats.\n- **R-3002 (Theo Park, silver)** \u2192 AL712 was full after the two gold passengers, so rebooked on the next-latest qualifying flight, AL706 (08:45\u201317:10), free of charge.\n- **R-3003** \u2192 basic economy fare, which can't be changed, so cancelled free of charge.\n- **R-3004** \u2192 notes indicated the passenger wanted a refund instead of rebooking, so cancelled free of charge.\n\nAll affected passengers have been notified of the outcome.", "type": "text"}], "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 1731, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 4302, "output_tokens": 324, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "server_tool_use": null, "service_tier": "standard"}, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "served_model": "claude-sonnet-5", "request_id": "req_011CfTLg9G7EnEnMc1iumPa7"}], "trace_id": "01M3GK2V8WTPHXW5K9ME2SK6F6", "agentlens": {"format": "agentlens/v1", "trace_id": "01M3GK2V8WTPHXW5K9ME2SK6F6", "name": "episode:tools/air_stack_disruption", "started_at": "2026-09-27T04:48:27.932380Z", "ended_at": "2026-09-27T04:48:56.730552Z", "duration_ms": 28798.172, "status": "ok", "attributes": {"episode_id": "tools-air_stack_disruption-01M3GK2V8WEAT8AED4XGK92033", "family": "tools", "task_id": "air_stack_disruption", "model": "claude-sonnet-5", "corpus": "agentlens-failure-corpus", "outcome": "pass"}, "cost_usd": 0.088351, "tokens": {"input": 11281, "output": 3028, "cache_read": 8655, "cache_write": 1731}, "spans": [{"span_id": "01M3GK2V8WH55PCBT9XR2583NQ", "trace_id": "01M3GK2V8WTPHXW5K9ME2SK6F6", "parent_span_id": null, "name": "episode:tools/air_stack_disruption", "type": "agent", "status": "ok", "started_at": "2026-09-27T04:48:27.932392Z", "ended_at": "2026-09-27T04:48:56.730516Z", "duration_ms": 28798.124, "attributes": {"episode_id": "tools-air_stack_disruption-01M3GK2V8WEAT8AED